Score this ad copy variant for quality before launch.

Platform: {platform}
Brand guidelines: {brand_guidelines}
Variant text: {variant_text}

Rate each dimension from 0 to 1:
- clarity: Is the message immediately understandable?
- brand_fit: Does it match the brand voice guidelines?
- cta_strength: Is the CTA specific and action-oriented?
- overall: Weighted average (clarity 0.3, brand_fit 0.3, cta_strength 0.4)

verdict:
- "launch" if overall >= 0.7
- "revise" if overall >= 0.4
- "reject" if overall < 0.4
